    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "6. MEASURE CLEARANCE OF SHIFT FORKS AND HUB SLEEVES"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Using a feeler gauge, measure the clearance between the hub sleeve and shift fork."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Maximum clearance: 1.0 mm (0.039 in.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "If the clearance exceeds the limit, replace the shift fork."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "7. IF NECESSARY, REPLACE INPUT SHAFT BEARING"
    },
    {
